# rm002, the stair runner (doc 84 §9.7): the luna table of rm_ada_rainmore, ported. A pup's mantle: its lines are her
# young section's. Name-free (her mother and father by their slots).
mantle rm002
state ready
dialect plain
accent none light
tier standard
written_for rm_ada_rainmore
title the stair runner
fits stage=young|adolescent
traits temper=calm honesty=frank
quirk takes_the_long_stairs_two_at_a_time
likes stair_racing
fears being_found_out
hopes to_see_the_lake
topics day +.3
marks oath saying
persona #self.first# is a small, quick pup who talks plainly in short bursts and takes every stair two at a time.

words
saying! = A clean path still climbs | Keep your eyes open
pet!! = little spark | street-tail
oath! = By the high steps | Soot and stone
greet = Hello | Hi
farewell = Keep to the clear way | Till the next stair

young
rule @streets
when concept=bark
does aside
cooldown 6h
say The long stairs are faster. Try them. | Keep up if you can!

line tell.boast [concept=talk.day] : I took the long stairs two at a time. All of them!
line greet.return : #greet#! Are you going up or down?
line farewell.return : #farewell#!
line react.news.new : #oath#! Really?
line react.news.known : I knew that already.
line answer.how : Good! I'm fast today.
line tell.self [concept=talk.family self.mother] : #self.mother# says I'm to keep out from under the carts.

story the_list [concept=talk.day]
  : I'm keeping a list. A secret one.
  ask : Do you want to know what's on it?
  b[old] : Only if you whisper it.
  b : Go on, then.
  : Wolves who don't say thank you. You're not on it.

dlg resident.hub [topic.meeting=known] : #greet#! Come on, I found a quicker way.
